Local AArch64 SE workloads for configs under gem5_library (e.g.
arm_a9_with_mcpat_and_hotspot.py).

Sources and Makefile live here; binaries are produced locally with `make`
(requires aarch64-linux-gnu-g++ and gem5 m5 headers). Built executables are
gitignored—do not commit dax, daxpy, iax, iaxpy, sax, or saxpy binaries.
